```erlang
State0 = libdecaf:xof_init({cshake128, <<>>, <<"orders/v1">>}),
State1 = libdecaf:xof_absorb(State0, <<"invoice-42">>),
{_State2, Output} = libdecaf:xof_squeeze(State1, 32),
Output = libdecaf:xof({cshake128, <<>>, <<"orders/v1">>}, <<"invoice-42">>, 32).
```
""".
